# Server-side mirror of .opencode/scripts/merge-class-a.sh's reserved-path list.
#
# The reserved paths are defined by `reserved_paths_regex` in .orchestrator.example/pins,
# byte-identical to `sensitive_pattern` in merge-class-a.sh. This file is the GitHub-side
# enforcement of the same list: a PR touching any path below requires @jq712 review before
# the ruleset on main will let it merge. The two lists MUST stay in sync.
#
# Entries present in BOTH the regex and this file (mapping is regex -> CODEOWNERS glob):
#   migrations/versions/            -> /migrations/versions/
#   deploy/                         -> /deploy/
#   .claude/                        -> /.claude/
#   docs/adr/                       -> /docs/adr/
#   src/finance_app/plaid/          -> /src/finance_app/plaid/
#   src/finance_app/agent/          -> /src/finance_app/agent/
#   .opencode/                      -> /.opencode/
#   .orchestrator.example/          -> /.orchestrator.example/
#   CLAUDE.md                       -> /CLAUDE.md
#   AGENTS.md                       -> /AGENTS.md
#   CLAUDE_FINANCE_APP_HANDOFF.md   -> /CLAUDE_FINANCE_APP_HANDOFF.md
#   docs/security-model.md          -> /docs/security-model.md
#   opencode.json                   -> /opencode.json
#
# Entries present ONLY here, not in the regex (known gap — the regex must be widened to match):
#   /.github/            (the CI workflow is the enforcement signal the ruleset trusts)
#   /.github/CODEOWNERS  (this file itself; must not change without owner review)
#
# Entries present ONLY in the regex, not here: none.
#
# When either list changes, update the other in the same change.

/migrations/versions/       @jq712
/deploy/                    @jq712
/.claude/                   @jq712
/docs/adr/                  @jq712
/src/finance_app/plaid/     @jq712
/src/finance_app/agent/     @jq712
/.opencode/                 @jq712
/.orchestrator.example/     @jq712
/CLAUDE.md                  @jq712
/AGENTS.md                  @jq712
/CLAUDE_FINANCE_APP_HANDOFF.md  @jq712
/docs/security-model.md     @jq712
/opencode.json              @jq712
/.github/                   @jq712
/.github/CODEOWNERS         @jq712
